<section id="faq" class="ns-section ns-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="ns-container ns-editorial-grid">
    <header class="ns-section-heading">
      <h2 id="faq-title" class="t-heading">Questions</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="ns-faq__items">
      <details>
        <summary>Do you work with the systems we already have?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Email, spreadsheets, a CRM, accounting software, or a custom app. I don't ask you to move the business onto a new platform first.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What if we already know which process to change?</summary>
        <p>Say so on the form. We can scope that work directly. The prices and what each project includes are on the How we work page.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Who owns the work when it is done?</summary>
        <p>You do, once the final invoice is paid: the configuration, prompts, code, and notes produced for you. The vendor's terms still apply to their service. I don't keep a right to your documents.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
